  "title": "AMERANT BANK APPOINTS TONY EELMAN AS EXECUTIVE VICE PRESIDENT AND CHIEF PRODUCT OFFICER",
  "summary": "Amerant Bank, Florida’s bank of choice with a growing presence across South Florida, is pleased to announce the appointment of Tony Eelman as EVP, Chief Product Officer. A senior financial services and mortgage-banking executive will now lead enterprise product strategy across the bank’s financial services and program-based lending platforms. In his new role, Eelman will …",
